@* The per-circuit root of the UI (03 section 3.2): MainLayout renders the page and the controls inside it. It renders no element of its own;
   its code-behind creates the circuit's session from the page URL and cascades it with the Demo UI overrides and the first-data watch (the two deadlines of 01 section 8.6,
   read by the banner and by the sheet). *@
<CascadingValue Value="Session" IsFixed="true">
    <CascadingValue Value="Overrides" IsFixed="true">
        <CascadingValue Value="FirstData" IsFixed="true">
            @ChildContent
        </CascadingValue>
    </CascadingValue>
</CascadingValue>
